    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Gina is 4 years older than her sister. When their ages are added together the result is 22. How old is Gina?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Gina is 13 years old.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be her sister’s age in years. Gina’s age is $(x+4)$ years.\n$$\\begin{align*}x+(x+4)&=22\\\\2x+4&=22\\\\2x&=18\\\\x&=9\\end{align*}$$\nGina is $9+4=13$ years old.",
